{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01R75ng97NBkBZ5QhdJ8pYKi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted data for each \"planned\" experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"median\" tier assumptions. I need to provide specific metric predictions with rationales for each planned experiment (plan_006 through plan_014).\n\nLet me go through each planned experiment and generate predictions consistent with the median tier definition.\n\nMedian tier key assumptions:\n- held-out eval GAR gap shrinks to 8-20x (data overlap partially inflated the original 30x)\n- Llama-3 GAR decay exists but gap is smaller (5-15x), gate reverse conditioning only in 50-75% of layers\n\n\n- Gradient conflict exists but isn't uniformly strong across checkpoints, with early training showing clearer patterns that fade later\n- The four-way ablation on held-out data suggests gating provides only marginal improvements over Dongre's approach, likely under 2 percentage points\n- Different GAR metrics may diverge when comparing our approach versus Dongre's on held-out evaluation\n\nNow I'm mapping out the specific predictions for each planned experiment, starting with plan_006 which analyzes gradient conflicts across three epoch checkpoints on v7, where I expect cosine similarity of gate parameters to hover near zero, gradient magnitude ratios between NTP and GAR to range from 3-8x, and consistency metrics to show moderate correlation around 0.4.\n\nFor plan_007, I need to think through what attention patterns should emerge qualitatively when gating is active versus inactive. Plan_008 focuses on held-out performance where I'm predicting the GAR-Dongre gap to be quite small, with the ratio between them spanning 8-20x depending on the metric. Then I'm moving to Llama-3 experiments—plan_009 will diagnose whether GAR decay patterns from v7 transfer to the larger model, and plan_010 will measure peak GAR during Llama-3 training and track how it decays relative to the baseline.\n\nFor plan_011, I'm running LoRA-only training on Llama-3 as a control. Plan_012 evaluates the full 3-way comparison on Llama-3, where I expect smaller absolute GAR values but similar gap ratios and wrong gate direction fractions. Plan_013 examines gradient conflicts in the Llama-3 setting, and plan_014 is a sanity check on downstream tasks to ensure the gating mechanism doesn't hurt actual task performance. Now I'm ready to write out detailed predictions for each of these plans.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17266,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17266},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a9b9732d-b919-4101-9fbd-61b486595261","uuid":"a8ccc718-9402-464c-a969-f57e6b9c579d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01R75ng97NBkBZ5QhdJ8pYKi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  将 \"30x gap\" 软化为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\"，不再以精确倍数作为标题级 claim。\n  Llama-3 降格为 \"supporting evidence of a consistent trend\" 而非 \"full replication\"。\n  梯度冲突从 \"持续压制\" 改为 \"训练早期的初始化偏差决定了 gate 学习方向\"。\n  若 gating 在 held-out 上显示微弱改善，需加 ablation 讨论并论证 effect size 无实际意义。\n  标题从 \"Cannot Fix\" 软化为 \"Fails to Fix\" 或 \"Does Not Generalize\"。\n  补充 2-3 个额外 seed 的 variance 分析。投稿目标仍冲 EMNLP Main，realistic 预期 Findings 3.0-3.5。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gradient Conflict Analysis (Qwen v7, 3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      在 v7 的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 上计算 NTP vs GAR loss 对 gate 参数的梯度余弦相似度和幅度比，\n      量化两者竞争关系及跨训练阶段的一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      # Epoch 0 checkpoint (early, ~step 1000)\n      ep0_cos_sim_avg_across_layers: -0.072\n      ep0_cos_sim_std: 0.035\n      ep0_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.82\n      ep0_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_avg: 7.2\n      ep0_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_std: 2.1\n      # Epoch 1 checkpoint (mid, ~step 2000)\n      ep1_cos_sim_avg_across_layers: -0.048\n      ep1_cos_sim_std: 0.042\n      ep1_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.71\n      ep1_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_avg: 5.8\n      ep1_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_std: 2.6\n      # Epoch 2 checkpoint (final, ~step 3000)\n      ep2_cos_sim_avg_across_layers: -0.031\n      ep2_cos_sim_std: 0.048\n      ep2_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.61\n      ep2_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_avg: 4.5\n      ep2_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_std: 3.0\n      # Cross-checkpoint summary\n      grad_cos_sim_gate_params_avg: -0.050\n      grad_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar: 5.8\n      grad_cos_sim_consistency_across_checkpoints: 0.55\n      layers_with_persistent_conflict_all_3_eps: 14  # out of 28\n      layers_conflict_only_ep0: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下梯度冲突真实存在但跨 checkpoint 不完全一致。\n      早期 checkpoint（epoch 0）冲突最强：GAR loss 梯度仍在尝试推动 gate 离开初始化值，\n      NTP 梯度强烈抵抗，cos_sim 平均 -0.072，82% 层呈现负相似度。\n      随训练收敛，GAR loss 已趋近零（final_avg_gar=0.001），GAR 梯度幅度急剧下降，\n      cos_sim 在 epoch 2 缓解到 -0.031，仅 61% 层仍为负——不是冲突消失，\n      而是 GAR 梯度变得太小以至于方向测量噪声增大。\n      幅度比从 7.2x 降到 4.5x 反映同样的动态：GAR 梯度萎缩使比值缩小。\n      这意味着 gate 的学习方向在训练极早期（phase A plateau 阶段）就已被 NTP 梯度锁定，\n      后续 phase B 的 GAR 上升是通过 LoRA 参数（而非 gate）实现的——\n      gate 本身被困在 NTP 偏好的 near-identity 区域。\n      跨 checkpoint 一致性 0.55 表明只有约一半的层展现稳定的冲突 pattern，\n      另一半在不同训练阶段方向摆动，削弱了 \"持续压制\" 的强 claim。\n      叙事需从 \"NTP 持续压制 GAR\" 调整为 \"NTP 在训练早期通过梯度优势锁定了 gate 初始化方向，\n      后续 GAR 优化绕过 gate 通过 LoRA 实现\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Layer Gradient Conflict Across Training Checkpoints\"\n        columns: [\"Layer Group\", \"Epoch 0 cos_sim\", \"Epoch 1 cos_sim\", \"Epoch 2 cos_sim\", \"Persistent?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-L6 (early)\", -0.058, -0.039, -0.021, \"4/7\"]\n          - [\"L7-L13 (mid-early)\", -0.091, -0.068, -0.052, \"5/7\"]\n          - [\"L14-L20 (mid-late)\", -0.084, -0.055, -0.033, \"4/7\"]\n          - [\"L21-L27 (late)\", -0.054, -0.031, -0.018, \"1/7\"]\n        caption: >\n          中间层（L7-L20）冲突最强且最持久，与这些层 gate 偏离 identity 最远的观察一致\n          （cf. plan_002 final_profile_L3=0.801, L4=0.789）。\n          晚期层（L21-L27）冲突弱且不持久，gate 值接近 1.0。\n      - name: \"Table: NTP/GAR Gradient Magnitude Ratio by Checkpoint\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"Mean Ratio\", \"Median Ratio\", \"Max Ratio (Layer)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0\", 7.2, 6.5, \"14.7 (L27)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1\", 5.8, 5.1, \"11.3 (L27)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2\", 4.5, 3.8, \"9.2 (L27)\"]\n        caption: >\n          NTP 梯度幅度始终数倍于 GAR，但差距随训练缩小——因为 GAR loss 趋零而非 NTP 减弱。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 28 层 x 3 checkpoint 的 cos_sim heatmap，颜色从深蓝（-0.1）到白（0）到红（+0.1）。中间层带状深蓝在 epoch 0 明显，逐渐褪色但不消失。\"\n      - \"Fig: 3 条线（ep0/1/2）的层级 NTP/GAR magnitude ratio，Y 轴 log scale。所有 checkpoint 后期层 ratio 最高（L27 峰值），前期层相对均衡。\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突存在但跨 checkpoint 不完全一致，14/28 层持续冲突，其余层摆动。\n      这支持 \"训练早期初始化偏差\" 叙事而非 \"持续压制\" 叙事。\n      论文中需将 SP2 从 \"NTP-GAR 梯度竞争的逐层量化\" 调整为\n      \"NTP 梯度在训练早期锁定 gate 学习方向的逐层证据\"。\n      中间层冲突最强且最持久，与 gate profile（L3=0.801, L4=0.789 偏离 identity 最远）\n      的对应关系可以作为 mechanistic 证据：冲突越强的层，gate 被推离 identity 越远。\n      但需要 caveat：epoch 2 的 cos_sim 不稳定（std > |mean|），\n      单 seed 下的可信度有限，需要 variance 分析。\n\n  - name: \"Attention Heatmap Visualization (4 models x 3 convs x 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only 4 个模型在 3 段对话上提取 28 层的 attention 权重，\n      可视化 goal tokens 上的注意力随 turn 的变化 pattern。\n    expected_results:\n      base_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.035\n      base_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      base_attn_decay_pattern: \"monotonic decrease with occasional spikes at turn boundaries\"\n      tg_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.032\n      tg_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009\n      tg_vs_base_attn_diff_avg: 0.001\n      tg_attn_distinguishable_from_base: false\n      ug_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.033\n      ug_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      ug_vs_base_attn_diff_avg: 0.0005\n      lora_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.034\n      lora_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009\n      lora_vs_base_attn_diff_avg: 0.001\n      cross_model_attn_pattern_similarity: \"high - all 4 models show near-identical attention decay\"\n      layer_variation: \"L0-L5 show highest goal attention; L20-L27 near-zero goal attention at all turns\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 4 个模型的推理时 attention pattern 几乎不可区分。\n      这是因为：(1) gate 在推理时 attenuation 仅 2-7%（NF3），\n      几乎不改变通过 residual stream 传递到 attention 层的信号；\n      (2) LoRA 微调主要影响 NTP 相关的 attention pattern 而非 goal-directed attention；\n      (3) 所有模型共享相同的 pre-trained attention structure，\n      而 goal attention 的衰减是 pre-trained model 的固有特性（长距离 attention 稀释）。\n      可视化的主要价值不在于模型间差异，而在于直观展示 attention 衰减的严重程度：\n      goal tokens 的 attention 从 early layers 的 3-4% 降到 late layers 的 <0.5%，\n      且随 turn 增加进一步压缩。这为 \"teacher-forcing 下学到的 attention pattern\n      不迁移到推理\" 提供视觉直觉——训练时 gold context 保持了 attention pathway，\n      推理时 model-generated context 逐渐污染该 pathway。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Goal Token Attention (%) by Model and Turn (averaged across layers and conversations)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 3.5, 1.8, 0.8, 0.5, 0.3]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 3.2, 1.7, 0.9, 0.5, 0.3]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 3.3, 1.8, 0.8, 0.5, 0.3]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 3.4, 1.9, 0.9, 0.6, 0.3]\n        caption: >\n          4 模型 attention 趋势几乎重合，gating 未能改变推理时的 attention 分配。\n          差异在 0.1-0.2pp 量级，远小于对话间 variance。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4x3 grid of attention heatmaps (4 models x 3 conversations)。每个 heatmap X 轴为 turn index，Y 轴为 layer index，颜色表示 goal token attention weight。所有 12 个 heatmap 呈现几乎相同的从左上角（高 attention）到右下角（低 attention）的渐变 pattern。\"\n      - \"Fig: Layer-wise attention profile at turn 1 vs turn 20，4 模型叠加。Turn 1 的 4 条曲线高度重叠（peak at L2-L4），turn 20 的 4 条曲线在接近零处重叠。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attention heatmap 是论文中最直观的 figure 之一。\n      核心信息：training 改变了 gate 值但推理时 attention pattern 不变——\n      这正是 distribution shift 的视觉证据。\n      4 模型不可区分进一步支持 C4（gating 无增量贡献）。\n      但 median 档需要 caveat：仅 3 段对话的可视化可能不代表整体分布，\n      需要在正文中引用 held-out eval 的统计结果作为补充。\n\n  - name: \"Held-Out Evaluation (50 convs, idx>=8000, 4-way)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      从 UltraChat 全集中抽取 idx>=8000 的 50 段对话构建 held-out eval set，\n      重跑四路消融 eval（Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only x GAR-ours/Dongre + PPL）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base model on held-out\n      ho_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0098\n      ho_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0025\n      ho_base_ppl: 4.35\n      ho_base_ntp: 1.4289\n      # ThreadGate on held-out\n      ho_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.0183\n      ho_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.032\n      ho_tg_ppl: 2.71\n      ho_tg_ntp: 0.9612\n      ho_tg_ours_recovery_pp: 0.85\n      ho_tg_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.95\n      # Uniform Gate on held-out\n      ho_ug_ours_mid_gar: 0.0171\n      ho_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.028\n      ho_ug_ppl: 2.69\n      ho_ug_ntp: 0.9558\n      ho_ug_ours_recovery_pp: 0.73\n      ho_ug_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.55\n      # LoRA-only on held-out\n      ho_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.0165\n      ho_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.025\n      ho_lora_ppl: 2.70\n      ho_lora_ntp: 0.9590\n      ho_lora_ours_recovery_pp: 0.67\n      ho_lora_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.25\n      # Key derived metrics\n      held_out_gar_gap_ratio_ours: 26.5  # training 0.486 / held-out 0.0183\n      held_out_gar_gap_ratio_dongre: 15.0  # training ~0.48 / held-out 0.032\n      held_out_inference_gar_dongre: 0.032\n      held_out_tg_minus_lora_gar_dongre: 0.007  # 0.032 - 0.025\n      held_out_tg_minus_lora_gar_ours: 0.0018  # 0.0183 - 0.0165\n      gar_ours_vs_dongre_pattern_divergence: true\n      # Variance across conversations\n      ho_tg_dongre_mid_gar_std_across_convs: 0.018\n      ho_tg_dongre_mid_gar_95ci: [0.027, 0.037]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：data overlap 确实部分膨胀了原始指标。\n      原始 eval 上 GAR-ours mid=0.4866（TG）极可能受训练数据泄露：\n      eval set 中的对话与训练集有 overlap，模型在 teacher-forcing 下\n      记住了这些特定对话的 attention pattern。\n      Held-out 上 GAR-ours 从 0.4866 骤降到 0.0183——\n      证实原始 eval 的高 GAR-ours 主要是 memorization 而非 generalization。\n      但 GAR-Dongre 呈现不同 pattern：原始 eval 上 TG dongre=0.0157，\n      held-out 上反而略升到 0.032。这是因为 GAR-Dongre 计算方式（仅 system prompt task tokens，\n      all response tokens）对特定对话的 memorization 更 robust——\n      Dongre 定义下的 attention pattern 更多反映模型的 general 行为而非对话记忆。\n      held-out 上 Dongre 值升高是因为 held-out 对话可能平均更短或 system prompt 更 salient，\n      但核心 gap 仍然巨大：training GAR ~0.48 vs held-out Dongre 0.032 = 15x gap。\n      这正好落在 median 档的 [8, 20] 范围内。\n      关键：TG vs LoRA-only 在 Dongre 指标上差 0.7pp（0.032 vs 0.025），\n      表面上 gating 有微弱改善，但 95% CI 重叠严重（std=0.018），\n      差异无统计显著性。这是 median 档的标志性预测——\n      不能再断言 \"gating 零贡献\"，但 effect size 无实际意义。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-Out Four-Way Eval (50 conversations, idx>=8000)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"PPL\", \"NTP Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.0098, 0.0025, 4.35, 1.4289]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.0183, 0.032, 2.71, 0.9612]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 0.0171, 0.028, 2.69, 0.9558]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.0165, 0.025, 2.70, 0.9590]\n        caption: >\n          Held-out 上 GAR-ours 急剧下降（TG: 0.487→0.018），确认 data overlap 膨胀。\n          GAR-Dongre 上 TG 微弱优于 LoRA-only 0.7pp 但无统计显著性。\n          PPL 三个 fine-tuned 模型几乎无差异。\n      - name: \"Table: Original vs Held-Out GAR Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Orig GAR-ours\", \"HO GAR-ours\", \"Orig GAR-Dongre\", \"HO GAR-Dongre\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.4866, 0.0183, 0.0157, 0.032]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 0.4923, 0.0171, 0.013, 0.028]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.486, 0.0165, 0.0137, 0.025]\n        caption: >\n          GAR-ours 和 GAR-Dongre 在 original→held-out 的变化方向相反：\n          ours 暴跌（memorization collapse），Dongre 微升（更 robust 的定义 + 数据分布差异）。\n          两种指标在 held-out 上均显示巨大的 training-inference gap。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart 对比 original eval vs held-out eval 的 4 模型 GAR-Dongre。两组 bar 并排，held-out 组略高但仍远低于 training GAR（虚线标注 training GAR=0.48）。\"\n      - \"Fig: TG vs LoRA-only 在 held-out 50 段对话上的 per-conversation GAR-Dongre scatter plot，大量 overlap，regression line 近乎 y=x。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 是 median 档的 pivotal experiment。\n      两个关键发现改变叙事：\n      (1) GAR gap 从 30x 缩小到 ~15x（Dongre 定义），需将标题级 claim 从精确倍数\n      软化为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\"；\n      (2) GAR-ours vs GAR-Dongre 在 held-out 上呈现不同 pattern（ours 暴跌，Dongre 微升），\n      需要在论文中讨论两种定义的 sensitivity 差异。\n      TG vs LoRA-only 的 0.7pp 差异需要认真处理：\n      如果不讨论，reviewer 会追问；\n      如果过度解读，会被批 cherry-picking。\n      建议策略：报告差异但明确指出 95% CI 重叠且 effect size 远小于\n      有实际意义的阈值（需定义），结论仍为 \"gating 无实际贡献\"。\n      补充 2-3 个 seed 的 variance 分析尤为重要——\n      如果跨 seed 的 TG-LoRA gap 方向不一致，则更有信心下此结论。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR Degradation Diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B base model 上复现 Phase 1 GAR 衰减诊断，确认 GAR decay 是否跨架构存在。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.0365\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0148\n      llama3_relative_drop: 0.595\n      llama3_num_conversations: 5\n      llama3_num_turns: 10\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar:\n        - 0.0365\n        - 0.0278\n        - 0.0232\n        - 0.0185\n        - 0.0163\n        - 0.0142\n        - 0.0118\n        - 0.0105\n        - 0.0098\n        - 0.0092\n      llama3_gar_decay_relative_pct: 44.5\n      llama3_decay_pattern: \"smoother monotonic decline vs Qwen's sharper early drop\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档假设 Llama-3 GAR 衰减存在但 pattern 不完全一致。\n      Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA（Grouped Query Attention）而 Qwen-2.5-7B 使用 standard MHA，\n      GQA 的 key-value sharing 可能在一定程度上缓冲 attention 稀释效应——\n      fewer KV heads 意味着 attention pattern 被更少的 head 共享，\n      每个 head 保留更多的 \"capacity\" 来 attend to goal tokens。\n      因此 relative drop 从 Qwen 的 70.8% 缓和到 ~45%（落在 median 范围 [30, 55] 内）。\n      但衰减方向一致——turn 1 到 turn 10 呈单调下降。\n      Llama-3 的 absolute GAR 值比 Qwen 更高（mid 0.0148 vs 0.0122），\n      这可能反映 Llama-3 更长的训练数据中多轮对话比例更高。\n      衰减曲线更平滑（无 Qwen 在 turn 3→4 的急剧跳降），\n      这可能让某些 reviewer 质疑 Llama 上的问题 \"没那么严重\"——\n      但 45% 的相对衰减仍然是实质性的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Qwen vs Llama-3 GAR Decay Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 1 GAR\", 0.0418, 0.0365]\n          - [\"Mid-turns GAR\", 0.0122, 0.0148]\n          - [\"Relative drop\", \"70.8%\", \"59.5%\"]\n          - [\"Decay pattern\", \"Sharp early drop\", \"Smooth monotonic\"]\n        caption: >\n          两个模型均展现显著 GAR 衰减，但 Llama-3 衰减幅度更小且曲线更平滑。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双线图，X 轴 turn index，Y 轴 avg GAR。Qwen 线更陡（早期急降），Llama 线更缓但同向下降。\"\n    analysis: >\n      GAR 衰减确认为跨架构现象，但量级差异（70.8% vs 59.5%）表明架构特性\n      （GQA vs MHA）会调节衰减幅度。\n      论文叙事需从 \"universal 70% drop\" 调整为\n      \"architecture-dependent degradation with consistent direction\"。\n      这实际上加强了 distribution shift 的 mechanistic argument——\n      不同架构的衰减幅度不同恰恰说明问题在 attention mechanism 层面而非数据层面。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复现 ThreadGate v7（MSE+gate_div）训练。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_tg_training_gar_peak: 0.28\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_ntp: 0.935\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_gar: 0.003\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_mean: 0.952\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_std: 0.038\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_min: 0.842\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_max: 0.992\n      llama3_tg_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-100):plateau@0.01 B(gs100-200):rise_to_0.28 C(gs200+):slow_climb_plateau@0.28\"\n      llama3_tg_gar_target_reached_at_gs: 200\n      llama3_tg_training_time_hours: 6.8\n      llama3_tg_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_tg_gate_direction: \"WRONG: 25/32 layers show reverse turn conditioning\"\n      llama3_wrong_gate_direction_layer_frac: 0.78\n      llama3_tg_gate_dynamic_range_top3:\n        L16:\n          turn1: 0.832\n          turn21: 0.961\n          diff: -0.129\n        L10:\n          turn1: 0.851\n          turn21: 0.948\n          diff: -0.097\n        L22:\n          turn1: 0.872\n          turn21: 0.956\n          diff: -0.084\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档假设 Llama-3 训练 GAR peak 更低（0.28 vs Qwen 0.48），\n      落在 [0.15, 0.35] 范围内。多个因素导致这一差异：\n      (1) Llama-3 有 32 层 vs Qwen 28 层，gate 参数更多，\n      优化 landscape 更复杂；\n      (2) GQA 结构使 attention 对 residual stream 变化的响应不同——\n      shared KV heads 意味着单个 gate 的调整影响更多 query head，\n      优化器需要更保守的更新；\n      (3) Llama-3 的 RoPE 实现与 Qwen 不同，\n      位置编码对 attention pattern 的约束可能使 GAR loss 的梯度更难传播。\n      training GAR 0.28 仍远高于推理 GAR（预测 ~0.028），gap ~10x，\n      落在 median 范围 [5, 15] 内。\n      Gate 反向 conditioning 在 25/32 层出现（78%），落在 [50%, 80%]——\n      不是所有层，暗示 Llama-3 的某些层（可能是 GQA 共享度不同的层）\n      对 gate 方向的响应不一致。\n      Gate dynamic range 比 Qwen 更窄（top diff -0.129 vs Qwen -0.21），\n      进一步说明 Llama 上 gate 学到的 turn-selective pattern 更弱。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Qwen vs Llama-3 ThreadGate Training Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", 0.48, 0.28]\n          - [\"Final gate mean\", 0.934, 0.952]\n          - [\"Gate min\", 0.789, 0.842]\n          - [\"Wrong-direction layers\", \"27/28 (96%)\", \"25/32 (78%)\"]\n          - [\"Max gate diff (turn1-turn21)\", -0.21, -0.129]\n          - [\"Training hours\", 5.9, 6.8]\n        caption: >\n          Llama-3 复现了 gate 反向 conditioning 但所有效应量级更小。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Llama-3 training curve 三阶段对比 Qwen training curve。Llama 的 phase B rise 更缓，plateau 更低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 训练结果是 \"partial replication\"：方向一致但效应更弱。\n      training GAR 仅 0.28 意味着即使在 teacher-forcing 下，\n      Llama-3 的 attention 对 residual gating 的响应也更有限。\n      这可以解读为 GQA 架构的内在限制（支持 mechanistic story），\n      也可以被 reviewer 解读为 \"超参可能没调好\"（W2 风险）。\n      需要在论文中论证：即使 training GAR 更低，\n      training-inference gap（10x）和 gate 反向 conditioning（78%）\n      仍然定性一致地支持 distribution shift hypothesis。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上训练 LoRA-only ablation，作为跨模型 gating 冗余性验证。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_global_steps: 3000\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 6.5\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp: 0.928\n      llama3_lora_final_lora_size_mb: 22\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 训练是纯 NTP fine-tuning，不涉及 gate 或 GAR loss。\n      Llama-3 的 LoRA-only 行为应与 Qwen 类似：标准 NTP 收敛。\n      训练时间略长于 Qwen（6.5h vs 5.7h）因为 Llama-3 有 32 层 vs 28 层，\n      LoRA 参数量更大（22MB vs 20MB）。\n      NTP loss 略低于 Qwen（0.928 vs 0.948）——Llama-3 在 UltraChat 类数据上\n      可能有更好的 prior，因为 Meta 的训练数据中可能包含了更多类似分布的对话数据。\n      此实验本身没有预期的 surprise，\n      但它是 plan_012 三路 eval 的必要 prerequisite。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      纯粹的 prerequisite 实验，核心价值在于为 plan_012 提供 baseline。\n      唯一值得注意的是 NTP loss 的跨模型差异——\n      如果 Llama LoRA-only 的 PPL 显著优于 Qwen LoRA-only，\n      需要在论文中 normalize 跨模型比较。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-Way Eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 held-out 数据上对 Llama-3.1-8B 的 Base/TG/LoRA-only 做三路 eval（GAR + PPL）。\n      注意这里直接使用 held-out data（Llama 未在任何 eval 数据上训练过）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Llama-3 Base\n      l3_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0135\n      l3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0042\n      l3_base_ppl: 3.98\n      l3_base_ntp: 1.3815\n      # Llama-3 ThreadGate\n      l3_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.0195\n      l3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.028\n      l3_tg_ppl: 2.55\n      l3_tg_ntp: 0.948\n      l3_tg_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.38\n      # Llama-3 LoRA-only\n      l3_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.0188\n      l3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.024\n      l3_lora_ppl: 2.52\n      l3_lora_ntp: 0.941\n      l3_lora_dongre_recovery_pp: 1.98\n      # Key derived metrics\n      llama3_inference_gar_dongre: 0.028\n      llama3_gar_gap_ratio: 10.0  # training 0.28 / inference 0.028\n      llama3_tg_minus_lora_dongre: 0.004\n      llama3_tg_minus_lora_significant: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 在 held-out eval 上的结果与 Qwen 定性一致但量级更小。\n      推理 GAR-Dongre 0.028 落在 median 范围 [0.015, 0.04]。\n      Training-inference gap 10x 落在 [5, 15]——显著但不像 Qwen 那么极端。\n      TG vs LoRA-only 在 Dongre 指标上差 0.4pp（0.028 vs 0.024），\n      方向与 Qwen 一致（TG 略高）但同样无统计显著性。\n      值得注意的是 Llama-3 base PPL 低于 Qwen（3.98 vs 4.35），\n      反映 Llama-3 对 UltraChat 类数据的更好 prior。\n      Fine-tuned 后 PPL 差异缩小，TG 和 LoRA-only 几乎相同（2.55 vs 2.52），\n      再次确认 gating 对 NTP 质量无显著影响。\n      叙事定位：Llama-3 结果不是 \"完美复现\" 而是 \"consistent trend\"——\n      gap 存在、gate 无增量、方向一致，但效应量级受架构调节。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B Three-Way Eval (held-out)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"PPL\", \"NTP Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.0135, 0.0042, 3.98, 1.3815]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.0195, 0.028, 2.55, 0.948]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.0188, 0.024, 2.52, 0.941]\n        caption: >\n          Llama-3 复现了 gating 无增量贡献的 pattern（TG ≈ LoRA-only on PPL and GAR）。\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Training-Inference Gap Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", 0.48, 0.28]\n          - [\"Inference GAR-Dongre (held-out)\", 0.032, 0.028]\n          - [\"GAR gap ratio\", \"~15x\", \"~10x\"]\n          - [\"TG - LoRA GAR-Dongre\", \"+0.7pp (n.s.)\", \"+0.4pp (n.s.)\"]\n          - [\"Gate wrong-direction frac\", \"96%\", \"78%\"]\n        caption: >\n          两模型方向一致但量级受架构调节。标题级 claim 应为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\" 而非精确倍数。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side bar charts，左 Qwen 右 Llama，每组 3 bars (Base/TG/LoRA-only) 的 GAR-Dongre。TG 和 LoRA-only 的 bar 几乎等高，远低于 training GAR 虚线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨模型比较的核心叙事：distribution shift 是 architecture-general 的，\n      但 gap 量级受架构特性（GQA vs MHA、层数、RoPE 实现）调节。\n      这既是 strength（普遍性）也是 limitation（不能 claim 精确的 gap 倍数）。\n      论文中需要一个 paragraph 讨论为什么 Llama-3 的 gap 更小，\n      候选解释：GQA 的 KV sharing 减缓 attention 稀释 +\n      Llama-3 更大的训练数据可能包含更多多轮对话 pattern。\n      但不应过度解读——两个模型、单 seed 不足以做因果推断。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Gradient Conflict Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate checkpoint 上计算 NTP vs GAR 梯度冲突，验证跨模型一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      l3_grad_cos_sim_avg: -0.038\n      l3_grad_cos_sim_std: 0.045\n      l3_grad_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.63\n      l3_grad_mag_ratio_avg: 4.2\n      l3_grad_mag_ratio_std: 2.0\n      l3_grad_conflict_consistent_with_qwen: \"directionally yes, weaker magnitude\"\n      l3_layers_with_conflict: 20  # out of 32\n      l3_gqa_group_analysis: \"conflict stronger in groups with fewer query heads per KV head\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 的梯度冲突弱于 Qwen（cos_sim -0.038 vs -0.050），\n      与 training GAR peak 更低一致——GAR loss 的梯度本身更小，\n      所以与 NTP 梯度的冲突在 magnitude 上更温和。\n      63% 层为负（vs Qwen ~68%），落在 median 范围的合理区间。\n      GQA 结构带来一个独特分析视角：不同 group 内的冲突可能不同。\n      具有更少 query heads per KV head 的 group 冲突更强——\n      因为 gate 调整对这些 group 的 attention 影响更集中。\n      这个 GQA-specific 的 finding 增加 mechanistic insight 的深度，\n      但也可能被 reviewer 认为是 over-interpretation（单模型、单 seed）。\n      幅度比 4.2x（vs Qwen 5.8x）再次确认 Llama-3 上效应更弱但同向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Gradient Conflict Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (28L)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B (32L)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cos_sim avg\", -0.050, -0.038]\n          - [\"Negative layer frac\", \"68%\", \"63%\"]\n          - [\"NTP/GAR mag ratio\", \"5.8x\", \"4.2x\"]\n          - [\"Persistently conflicting layers\", \"14/28 (50%)\", \"20/32 (63%)\"]\n        caption: >\n          两模型均展现 NTP-GAR 梯度冲突，Llama-3 效应更弱但层级覆盖更广（因总层数更多）。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 heatmap 并排，左 Qwen 28 层 x 1 checkpoint，右 Llama 32 层 x 1 checkpoint。颜色编码 cos_sim。两者中间层都是最深蓝但 Llama 整体颜色更浅。\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突跨模型一致性在 median 档下是 \"方向一致但量级不同\"。\n      这对论文是 net positive：证明冲突不是 Qwen 的 artifact，\n      但也表明冲突强度是 architecture-dependent 的。\n      GQA group 分析如果做得好可以是一个 interesting sub-finding，\n      但考虑到只有单 seed、单 checkpoint，建议放 appendix。\n      P1 优先级意味着时间紧张时可以省略此实验——\n      plan_012 的 eval 结果已经足够支持跨模型验证，\n      梯度分析是 mechanistic bonus 而非 must-have。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Sanity Check (Instruction Retention)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      设计简单的 instruction retention test：在 system prompt 中给出格式约束（如 \"回答必须以'[ANS]'开头\"），\n      测量不同 turn 数下各模型的 compliance rate，将 GAR 与下游行为关联。\n    expected_results:\n      # Compliance rate by turn (averaged across 50 instructions)\n      base_compliance_turn1: 0.82\n      base_compliance_turn5: 0.68\n      base_compliance_turn10: 0.52\n      base_compliance_turn15: 0.41\n      base_compliance_turn20: 0.33\n      tg_compliance_turn1: 0.83\n      tg_compliance_turn5: 0.70\n      tg_compliance_turn10: 0.54\n      tg_compliance_turn15: 0.42\n      tg_compliance_turn20: 0.34\n      lora_compliance_turn1: 0.83\n      lora_compliance_turn5: 0.69\n      lora_compliance_turn10: 0.53\n      lora_compliance_turn15: 0.42\n      lora_compliance_turn20: 0.34\n      gar_compliance_correlation: 0.72\n      tg_vs_base_compliance_improvement_avg_pp: 1.5\n      tg_vs_lora_compliance_improvement_avg_pp: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 GAR 与 compliance rate 有中等正相关（r=0.72）——\n      attention to goal tokens 的衰减确实对应 instruction following 的退化，\n      但关系不是 1:1（GAR 是必要非充分条件：\n      模型可能通过 residual stream 中未被 attention 访问的信息仍保持部分 compliance）。\n      Compliance 的衰减曲线比 GAR 更 gentle（从 82% 到 33% vs GAR 从 0.04 到 0.006），\n      因为简单格式指令可以被 model 通过 shortcut 记住（如 learned positional bias）\n      而不完全依赖 attention to goal tokens。\n      关键：TG 对 compliance 几乎无改善（vs base +1.5pp，vs LoRA-only +0.3pp），\n      与 GAR eval 结果一致——推理时 gate 无实际干预能力。\n      这个实验的主要价值不是展示 gating 失败（已有大量证据），\n      而是 validate GAR 作为代理指标的合理性：\n      GAR 衰减确实 track 真实的下游退化，而不只是一个与行为无关的数字。\n      但相关系数 0.72（非 0.95+）也表明 GAR 不是完美代理——\n      需要在论文中承认这个局限性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction Compliance Rate (%) by Model and Turn\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 82, 68, 52, 41, 33]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 83, 70, 54, 42, 34]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 83, 69, 53, 42, 34]\n        caption: >\n          所有模型 compliance rate 随 turn 单调下降。\n          TG 对 compliance 的改善 ≤1.5pp，与 GAR eval 一致。\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-Compliance Correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Metric Pair\", \"Pearson r\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GAR-Dongre vs Compliance (pooled)\", 0.72, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"GAR-ours vs Compliance (pooled)\", 0.68, \"<0.001\"]\n        caption: >\n          GAR 与 compliance 中等正相关，支持 GAR 作为代理指标但非完美代理。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 Y 轴图，左轴 compliance rate (%)，右轴 GAR-Dongre。X 轴 turn index。两条曲线同步下降但斜率不同。标注 r=0.72。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream sanity check 的定位是 address W3（GAR 作为唯一代理指标的质疑）。\n      r=0.72 足以 justify GAR 的 relevance 但不能声称 GAR 是完美代理。\n      论文中可以写 \"GAR decline tracks measurable degradation in instruction following\n      (r=0.72, p<0.001), though the relationship is imperfect,\n      suggesting compensatory mechanisms beyond the attention channel.\"\n      这个实验是 P2 优先级——如果时间充裕则做，如果紧张则在 limitation 中承认\n      \"GAR-to-task correlation was not empirically measured\" 并引用 Dongre 的类似分析。\n      注意 compliance rate 的绝对值（82% at turn 1）可能因指令设计而异——\n      需要选择足够简单的格式约束确保 turn 1 baseline 高，否则 ceiling 太低看不到衰减。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17266,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17266},"output_tokens":20,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a9b9732d-b919-4101-9fbd-61b486595261","uuid":"fd130991-5e59-423a-9d1a-4485815e7cde"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":263072,"duration_api_ms":264623,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  将 \"30x gap\" 软化为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\"，不再以精确倍数作为标题级 claim。\n  Llama-3 降格为 \"supporting evidence of a consistent trend\" 而非 \"full replication\"。\n  梯度冲突从 \"持续压制\" 改为 \"训练早期的初始化偏差决定了 gate 学习方向\"。\n  若 gating 在 held-out 上显示微弱改善，需加 ablation 讨论并论证 effect size 无实际意义。\n  标题从 \"Cannot Fix\" 软化为 \"Fails to Fix\" 或 \"Does Not Generalize\"。\n  补充 2-3 个额外 seed 的 variance 分析。投稿目标仍冲 EMNLP Main，realistic 预期 Findings 3.0-3.5。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gradient Conflict Analysis (Qwen v7, 3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      在 v7 的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 上计算 NTP vs GAR loss 对 gate 参数的梯度余弦相似度和幅度比，\n      量化两者竞争关系及跨训练阶段的一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      # Epoch 0 checkpoint (early, ~step 1000)\n      ep0_cos_sim_avg_across_layers: -0.072\n      ep0_cos_sim_std: 0.035\n      ep0_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.82\n      ep0_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_avg: 7.2\n      ep0_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_std: 2.1\n      # Epoch 1 checkpoint (mid, ~step 2000)\n      ep1_cos_sim_avg_across_layers: -0.048\n      ep1_cos_sim_std: 0.042\n      ep1_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.71\n      ep1_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_avg: 5.8\n      ep1_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_std: 2.6\n      # Epoch 2 checkpoint (final, ~step 3000)\n      ep2_cos_sim_avg_across_layers: -0.031\n      ep2_cos_sim_std: 0.048\n      ep2_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.61\n      ep2_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_avg: 4.5\n      ep2_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar_std: 3.0\n      # Cross-checkpoint summary\n      grad_cos_sim_gate_params_avg: -0.050\n      grad_mag_ratio_ntp_over_gar: 5.8\n      grad_cos_sim_consistency_across_checkpoints: 0.55\n      layers_with_persistent_conflict_all_3_eps: 14  # out of 28\n      layers_conflict_only_ep0: 6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下梯度冲突真实存在但跨 checkpoint 不完全一致。\n      早期 checkpoint（epoch 0）冲突最强：GAR loss 梯度仍在尝试推动 gate 离开初始化值，\n      NTP 梯度强烈抵抗，cos_sim 平均 -0.072，82% 层呈现负相似度。\n      随训练收敛，GAR loss 已趋近零（final_avg_gar=0.001），GAR 梯度幅度急剧下降，\n      cos_sim 在 epoch 2 缓解到 -0.031，仅 61% 层仍为负——不是冲突消失，\n      而是 GAR 梯度变得太小以至于方向测量噪声增大。\n      幅度比从 7.2x 降到 4.5x 反映同样的动态：GAR 梯度萎缩使比值缩小。\n      这意味着 gate 的学习方向在训练极早期（phase A plateau 阶段）就已被 NTP 梯度锁定，\n      后续 phase B 的 GAR 上升是通过 LoRA 参数（而非 gate）实现的——\n      gate 本身被困在 NTP 偏好的 near-identity 区域。\n      跨 checkpoint 一致性 0.55 表明只有约一半的层展现稳定的冲突 pattern，\n      另一半在不同训练阶段方向摆动，削弱了 \"持续压制\" 的强 claim。\n      叙事需从 \"NTP 持续压制 GAR\" 调整为 \"NTP 在训练早期通过梯度优势锁定了 gate 初始化方向，\n      后续 GAR 优化绕过 gate 通过 LoRA 实现\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Layer Gradient Conflict Across Training Checkpoints\"\n        columns: [\"Layer Group\", \"Epoch 0 cos_sim\", \"Epoch 1 cos_sim\", \"Epoch 2 cos_sim\", \"Persistent?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-L6 (early)\", -0.058, -0.039, -0.021, \"4/7\"]\n          - [\"L7-L13 (mid-early)\", -0.091, -0.068, -0.052, \"5/7\"]\n          - [\"L14-L20 (mid-late)\", -0.084, -0.055, -0.033, \"4/7\"]\n          - [\"L21-L27 (late)\", -0.054, -0.031, -0.018, \"1/7\"]\n        caption: >\n          中间层（L7-L20）冲突最强且最持久，与这些层 gate 偏离 identity 最远的观察一致\n          （cf. plan_002 final_profile_L3=0.801, L4=0.789）。\n          晚期层（L21-L27）冲突弱且不持久，gate 值接近 1.0。\n      - name: \"Table: NTP/GAR Gradient Magnitude Ratio by Checkpoint\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"Mean Ratio\", \"Median Ratio\", \"Max Ratio (Layer)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0\", 7.2, 6.5, \"14.7 (L27)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1\", 5.8, 5.1, \"11.3 (L27)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2\", 4.5, 3.8, \"9.2 (L27)\"]\n        caption: >\n          NTP 梯度幅度始终数倍于 GAR，但差距随训练缩小——因为 GAR loss 趋零而非 NTP 减弱。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 28 层 x 3 checkpoint 的 cos_sim heatmap，颜色从深蓝（-0.1）到白（0）到红（+0.1）。中间层带状深蓝在 epoch 0 明显，逐渐褪色但不消失。\"\n      - \"Fig: 3 条线（ep0/1/2）的层级 NTP/GAR magnitude ratio，Y 轴 log scale。所有 checkpoint 后期层 ratio 最高（L27 峰值），前期层相对均衡。\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突存在但跨 checkpoint 不完全一致，14/28 层持续冲突，其余层摆动。\n      这支持 \"训练早期初始化偏差\" 叙事而非 \"持续压制\" 叙事。\n      论文中需将 SP2 从 \"NTP-GAR 梯度竞争的逐层量化\" 调整为\n      \"NTP 梯度在训练早期锁定 gate 学习方向的逐层证据\"。\n      中间层冲突最强且最持久，与 gate profile（L3=0.801, L4=0.789 偏离 identity 最远）\n      的对应关系可以作为 mechanistic 证据：冲突越强的层，gate 被推离 identity 越远。\n      但需要 caveat：epoch 2 的 cos_sim 不稳定（std > |mean|），\n      单 seed 下的可信度有限，需要 variance 分析。\n\n  - name: \"Attention Heatmap Visualization (4 models x 3 convs x 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only 4 个模型在 3 段对话上提取 28 层的 attention 权重，\n      可视化 goal tokens 上的注意力随 turn 的变化 pattern。\n    expected_results:\n      base_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.035\n      base_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      base_attn_decay_pattern: \"monotonic decrease with occasional spikes at turn boundaries\"\n      tg_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.032\n      tg_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009\n      tg_vs_base_attn_diff_avg: 0.001\n      tg_attn_distinguishable_from_base: false\n      ug_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.033\n      ug_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      ug_vs_base_attn_diff_avg: 0.0005\n      lora_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.034\n      lora_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009\n      lora_vs_base_attn_diff_avg: 0.001\n      cross_model_attn_pattern_similarity: \"high - all 4 models show near-identical attention decay\"\n      layer_variation: \"L0-L5 show highest goal attention; L20-L27 near-zero goal attention at all turns\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 4 个模型的推理时 attention pattern 几乎不可区分。\n      这是因为：(1) gate 在推理时 attenuation 仅 2-7%（NF3），\n      几乎不改变通过 residual stream 传递到 attention 层的信号；\n      (2) LoRA 微调主要影响 NTP 相关的 attention pattern 而非 goal-directed attention；\n      (3) 所有模型共享相同的 pre-trained attention structure，\n      而 goal attention 的衰减是 pre-trained model 的固有特性（长距离 attention 稀释）。\n      可视化的主要价值不在于模型间差异，而在于直观展示 attention 衰减的严重程度：\n      goal tokens 的 attention 从 early layers 的 3-4% 降到 late layers 的 <0.5%，\n      且随 turn 增加进一步压缩。这为 \"teacher-forcing 下学到的 attention pattern\n      不迁移到推理\" 提供视觉直觉——训练时 gold context 保持了 attention pathway，\n      推理时 model-generated context 逐渐污染该 pathway。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Goal Token Attention (%) by Model and Turn (averaged across layers and conversations)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 3.5, 1.8, 0.8, 0.5, 0.3]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 3.2, 1.7, 0.9, 0.5, 0.3]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 3.3, 1.8, 0.8, 0.5, 0.3]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 3.4, 1.9, 0.9, 0.6, 0.3]\n        caption: >\n          4 模型 attention 趋势几乎重合，gating 未能改变推理时的 attention 分配。\n          差异在 0.1-0.2pp 量级，远小于对话间 variance。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4x3 grid of attention heatmaps (4 models x 3 conversations)。每个 heatmap X 轴为 turn index，Y 轴为 layer index，颜色表示 goal token attention weight。所有 12 个 heatmap 呈现几乎相同的从左上角（高 attention）到右下角（低 attention）的渐变 pattern。\"\n      - \"Fig: Layer-wise attention profile at turn 1 vs turn 20，4 模型叠加。Turn 1 的 4 条曲线高度重叠（peak at L2-L4），turn 20 的 4 条曲线在接近零处重叠。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attention heatmap 是论文中最直观的 figure 之一。\n      核心信息：training 改变了 gate 值但推理时 attention pattern 不变——\n      这正是 distribution shift 的视觉证据。\n      4 模型不可区分进一步支持 C4（gating 无增量贡献）。\n      但 median 档需要 caveat：仅 3 段对话的可视化可能不代表整体分布，\n      需要在正文中引用 held-out eval 的统计结果作为补充。\n\n  - name: \"Held-Out Evaluation (50 convs, idx>=8000, 4-way)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      从 UltraChat 全集中抽取 idx>=8000 的 50 段对话构建 held-out eval set，\n      重跑四路消融 eval（Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only x GAR-ours/Dongre + PPL）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base model on held-out\n      ho_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0098\n      ho_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0025\n      ho_base_ppl: 4.35\n      ho_base_ntp: 1.4289\n      # ThreadGate on held-out\n      ho_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.0183\n      ho_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.032\n      ho_tg_ppl: 2.71\n      ho_tg_ntp: 0.9612\n      ho_tg_ours_recovery_pp: 0.85\n      ho_tg_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.95\n      # Uniform Gate on held-out\n      ho_ug_ours_mid_gar: 0.0171\n      ho_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.028\n      ho_ug_ppl: 2.69\n      ho_ug_ntp: 0.9558\n      ho_ug_ours_recovery_pp: 0.73\n      ho_ug_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.55\n      # LoRA-only on held-out\n      ho_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.0165\n      ho_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.025\n      ho_lora_ppl: 2.70\n      ho_lora_ntp: 0.9590\n      ho_lora_ours_recovery_pp: 0.67\n      ho_lora_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.25\n      # Key derived metrics\n      held_out_gar_gap_ratio_ours: 26.5  # training 0.486 / held-out 0.0183\n      held_out_gar_gap_ratio_dongre: 15.0  # training ~0.48 / held-out 0.032\n      held_out_inference_gar_dongre: 0.032\n      held_out_tg_minus_lora_gar_dongre: 0.007  # 0.032 - 0.025\n      held_out_tg_minus_lora_gar_ours: 0.0018  # 0.0183 - 0.0165\n      gar_ours_vs_dongre_pattern_divergence: true\n      # Variance across conversations\n      ho_tg_dongre_mid_gar_std_across_convs: 0.018\n      ho_tg_dongre_mid_gar_95ci: [0.027, 0.037]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档核心假设：data overlap 确实部分膨胀了原始指标。\n      原始 eval 上 GAR-ours mid=0.4866（TG）极可能受训练数据泄露：\n      eval set 中的对话与训练集有 overlap，模型在 teacher-forcing 下\n      记住了这些特定对话的 attention pattern。\n      Held-out 上 GAR-ours 从 0.4866 骤降到 0.0183——\n      证实原始 eval 的高 GAR-ours 主要是 memorization 而非 generalization。\n      但 GAR-Dongre 呈现不同 pattern：原始 eval 上 TG dongre=0.0157，\n      held-out 上反而略升到 0.032。这是因为 GAR-Dongre 计算方式（仅 system prompt task tokens，\n      all response tokens）对特定对话的 memorization 更 robust——\n      Dongre 定义下的 attention pattern 更多反映模型的 general 行为而非对话记忆。\n      held-out 上 Dongre 值升高是因为 held-out 对话可能平均更短或 system prompt 更 salient，\n      但核心 gap 仍然巨大：training GAR ~0.48 vs held-out Dongre 0.032 = 15x gap。\n      这正好落在 median 档的 [8, 20] 范围内。\n      关键：TG vs LoRA-only 在 Dongre 指标上差 0.7pp（0.032 vs 0.025），\n      表面上 gating 有微弱改善，但 95% CI 重叠严重（std=0.018），\n      差异无统计显著性。这是 median 档的标志性预测——\n      不能再断言 \"gating 零贡献\"，但 effect size 无实际意义。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-Out Four-Way Eval (50 conversations, idx>=8000)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"PPL\", \"NTP Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.0098, 0.0025, 4.35, 1.4289]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.0183, 0.032, 2.71, 0.9612]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 0.0171, 0.028, 2.69, 0.9558]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.0165, 0.025, 2.70, 0.9590]\n        caption: >\n          Held-out 上 GAR-ours 急剧下降（TG: 0.487→0.018），确认 data overlap 膨胀。\n          GAR-Dongre 上 TG 微弱优于 LoRA-only 0.7pp 但无统计显著性。\n          PPL 三个 fine-tuned 模型几乎无差异。\n      - name: \"Table: Original vs Held-Out GAR Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Orig GAR-ours\", \"HO GAR-ours\", \"Orig GAR-Dongre\", \"HO GAR-Dongre\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.4866, 0.0183, 0.0157, 0.032]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 0.4923, 0.0171, 0.013, 0.028]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.486, 0.0165, 0.0137, 0.025]\n        caption: >\n          GAR-ours 和 GAR-Dongre 在 original→held-out 的变化方向相反：\n          ours 暴跌（memorization collapse），Dongre 微升（更 robust 的定义 + 数据分布差异）。\n          两种指标在 held-out 上均显示巨大的 training-inference gap。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart 对比 original eval vs held-out eval 的 4 模型 GAR-Dongre。两组 bar 并排，held-out 组略高但仍远低于 training GAR（虚线标注 training GAR=0.48）。\"\n      - \"Fig: TG vs LoRA-only 在 held-out 50 段对话上的 per-conversation GAR-Dongre scatter plot，大量 overlap，regression line 近乎 y=x。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 是 median 档的 pivotal experiment。\n      两个关键发现改变叙事：\n      (1) GAR gap 从 30x 缩小到 ~15x（Dongre 定义），需将标题级 claim 从精确倍数\n      软化为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\"；\n      (2) GAR-ours vs GAR-Dongre 在 held-out 上呈现不同 pattern（ours 暴跌，Dongre 微升），\n      需要在论文中讨论两种定义的 sensitivity 差异。\n      TG vs LoRA-only 的 0.7pp 差异需要认真处理：\n      如果不讨论，reviewer 会追问；\n      如果过度解读，会被批 cherry-picking。\n      建议策略：报告差异但明确指出 95% CI 重叠且 effect size 远小于\n      有实际意义的阈值（需定义），结论仍为 \"gating 无实际贡献\"。\n      补充 2-3 个 seed 的 variance 分析尤为重要——\n      如果跨 seed 的 TG-LoRA gap 方向不一致，则更有信心下此结论。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR Degradation Diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B base model 上复现 Phase 1 GAR 衰减诊断，确认 GAR decay 是否跨架构存在。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.0365\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0148\n      llama3_relative_drop: 0.595\n      llama3_num_conversations: 5\n      llama3_num_turns: 10\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar:\n        - 0.0365\n        - 0.0278\n        - 0.0232\n        - 0.0185\n        - 0.0163\n        - 0.0142\n        - 0.0118\n        - 0.0105\n        - 0.0098\n        - 0.0092\n      llama3_gar_decay_relative_pct: 44.5\n      llama3_decay_pattern: \"smoother monotonic decline vs Qwen's sharper early drop\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档假设 Llama-3 GAR 衰减存在但 pattern 不完全一致。\n      Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA（Grouped Query Attention）而 Qwen-2.5-7B 使用 standard MHA，\n      GQA 的 key-value sharing 可能在一定程度上缓冲 attention 稀释效应——\n      fewer KV heads 意味着 attention pattern 被更少的 head 共享，\n      每个 head 保留更多的 \"capacity\" 来 attend to goal tokens。\n      因此 relative drop 从 Qwen 的 70.8% 缓和到 ~45%（落在 median 范围 [30, 55] 内）。\n      但衰减方向一致——turn 1 到 turn 10 呈单调下降。\n      Llama-3 的 absolute GAR 值比 Qwen 更高（mid 0.0148 vs 0.0122），\n      这可能反映 Llama-3 更长的训练数据中多轮对话比例更高。\n      衰减曲线更平滑（无 Qwen 在 turn 3→4 的急剧跳降），\n      这可能让某些 reviewer 质疑 Llama 上的问题 \"没那么严重\"——\n      但 45% 的相对衰减仍然是实质性的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Qwen vs Llama-3 GAR Decay Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 1 GAR\", 0.0418, 0.0365]\n          - [\"Mid-turns GAR\", 0.0122, 0.0148]\n          - [\"Relative drop\", \"70.8%\", \"59.5%\"]\n          - [\"Decay pattern\", \"Sharp early drop\", \"Smooth monotonic\"]\n        caption: >\n          两个模型均展现显著 GAR 衰减，但 Llama-3 衰减幅度更小且曲线更平滑。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双线图，X 轴 turn index，Y 轴 avg GAR。Qwen 线更陡（早期急降），Llama 线更缓但同向下降。\"\n    analysis: >\n      GAR 衰减确认为跨架构现象，但量级差异（70.8% vs 59.5%）表明架构特性\n      （GQA vs MHA）会调节衰减幅度。\n      论文叙事需从 \"universal 70% drop\" 调整为\n      \"architecture-dependent degradation with consistent direction\"。\n      这实际上加强了 distribution shift 的 mechanistic argument——\n      不同架构的衰减幅度不同恰恰说明问题在 attention mechanism 层面而非数据层面。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复现 ThreadGate v7（MSE+gate_div）训练。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_tg_training_gar_peak: 0.28\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_ntp: 0.935\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_gar: 0.003\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_mean: 0.952\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_std: 0.038\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_min: 0.842\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_max: 0.992\n      llama3_tg_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-100):plateau@0.01 B(gs100-200):rise_to_0.28 C(gs200+):slow_climb_plateau@0.28\"\n      llama3_tg_gar_target_reached_at_gs: 200\n      llama3_tg_training_time_hours: 6.8\n      llama3_tg_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_tg_gate_direction: \"WRONG: 25/32 layers show reverse turn conditioning\"\n      llama3_wrong_gate_direction_layer_frac: 0.78\n      llama3_tg_gate_dynamic_range_top3:\n        L16:\n          turn1: 0.832\n          turn21: 0.961\n          diff: -0.129\n        L10:\n          turn1: 0.851\n          turn21: 0.948\n          diff: -0.097\n        L22:\n          turn1: 0.872\n          turn21: 0.956\n          diff: -0.084\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档假设 Llama-3 训练 GAR peak 更低（0.28 vs Qwen 0.48），\n      落在 [0.15, 0.35] 范围内。多个因素导致这一差异：\n      (1) Llama-3 有 32 层 vs Qwen 28 层，gate 参数更多，\n      优化 landscape 更复杂；\n      (2) GQA 结构使 attention 对 residual stream 变化的响应不同——\n      shared KV heads 意味着单个 gate 的调整影响更多 query head，\n      优化器需要更保守的更新；\n      (3) Llama-3 的 RoPE 实现与 Qwen 不同，\n      位置编码对 attention pattern 的约束可能使 GAR loss 的梯度更难传播。\n      training GAR 0.28 仍远高于推理 GAR（预测 ~0.028），gap ~10x，\n      落在 median 范围 [5, 15] 内。\n      Gate 反向 conditioning 在 25/32 层出现（78%），落在 [50%, 80%]——\n      不是所有层，暗示 Llama-3 的某些层（可能是 GQA 共享度不同的层）\n      对 gate 方向的响应不一致。\n      Gate dynamic range 比 Qwen 更窄（top diff -0.129 vs Qwen -0.21），\n      进一步说明 Llama 上 gate 学到的 turn-selective pattern 更弱。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Qwen vs Llama-3 ThreadGate Training Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", 0.48, 0.28]\n          - [\"Final gate mean\", 0.934, 0.952]\n          - [\"Gate min\", 0.789, 0.842]\n          - [\"Wrong-direction layers\", \"27/28 (96%)\", \"25/32 (78%)\"]\n          - [\"Max gate diff (turn1-turn21)\", -0.21, -0.129]\n          - [\"Training hours\", 5.9, 6.8]\n        caption: >\n          Llama-3 复现了 gate 反向 conditioning 但所有效应量级更小。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Llama-3 training curve 三阶段对比 Qwen training curve。Llama 的 phase B rise 更缓，plateau 更低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 训练结果是 \"partial replication\"：方向一致但效应更弱。\n      training GAR 仅 0.28 意味着即使在 teacher-forcing 下，\n      Llama-3 的 attention 对 residual gating 的响应也更有限。\n      这可以解读为 GQA 架构的内在限制（支持 mechanistic story），\n      也可以被 reviewer 解读为 \"超参可能没调好\"（W2 风险）。\n      需要在论文中论证：即使 training GAR 更低，\n      training-inference gap（10x）和 gate 反向 conditioning（78%）\n      仍然定性一致地支持 distribution shift hypothesis。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上训练 LoRA-only ablation，作为跨模型 gating 冗余性验证。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_global_steps: 3000\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 6.5\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp: 0.928\n      llama3_lora_final_lora_size_mb: 22\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 训练是纯 NTP fine-tuning，不涉及 gate 或 GAR loss。\n      Llama-3 的 LoRA-only 行为应与 Qwen 类似：标准 NTP 收敛。\n      训练时间略长于 Qwen（6.5h vs 5.7h）因为 Llama-3 有 32 层 vs 28 层，\n      LoRA 参数量更大（22MB vs 20MB）。\n      NTP loss 略低于 Qwen（0.928 vs 0.948）——Llama-3 在 UltraChat 类数据上\n      可能有更好的 prior，因为 Meta 的训练数据中可能包含了更多类似分布的对话数据。\n      此实验本身没有预期的 surprise，\n      但它是 plan_012 三路 eval 的必要 prerequisite。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      纯粹的 prerequisite 实验，核心价值在于为 plan_012 提供 baseline。\n      唯一值得注意的是 NTP loss 的跨模型差异——\n      如果 Llama LoRA-only 的 PPL 显著优于 Qwen LoRA-only，\n      需要在论文中 normalize 跨模型比较。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-Way Eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 held-out 数据上对 Llama-3.1-8B 的 Base/TG/LoRA-only 做三路 eval（GAR + PPL）。\n      注意这里直接使用 held-out data（Llama 未在任何 eval 数据上训练过）。\n    expected_results:\n      # Llama-3 Base\n      l3_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0135\n      l3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0042\n      l3_base_ppl: 3.98\n      l3_base_ntp: 1.3815\n      # Llama-3 ThreadGate\n      l3_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.0195\n      l3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.028\n      l3_tg_ppl: 2.55\n      l3_tg_ntp: 0.948\n      l3_tg_dongre_recovery_pp: 2.38\n      # Llama-3 LoRA-only\n      l3_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.0188\n      l3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.024\n      l3_lora_ppl: 2.52\n      l3_lora_ntp: 0.941\n      l3_lora_dongre_recovery_pp: 1.98\n      # Key derived metrics\n      llama3_inference_gar_dongre: 0.028\n      llama3_gar_gap_ratio: 10.0  # training 0.28 / inference 0.028\n      llama3_tg_minus_lora_dongre: 0.004\n      llama3_tg_minus_lora_significant: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 在 held-out eval 上的结果与 Qwen 定性一致但量级更小。\n      推理 GAR-Dongre 0.028 落在 median 范围 [0.015, 0.04]。\n      Training-inference gap 10x 落在 [5, 15]——显著但不像 Qwen 那么极端。\n      TG vs LoRA-only 在 Dongre 指标上差 0.4pp（0.028 vs 0.024），\n      方向与 Qwen 一致（TG 略高）但同样无统计显著性。\n      值得注意的是 Llama-3 base PPL 低于 Qwen（3.98 vs 4.35），\n      反映 Llama-3 对 UltraChat 类数据的更好 prior。\n      Fine-tuned 后 PPL 差异缩小，TG 和 LoRA-only 几乎相同（2.55 vs 2.52），\n      再次确认 gating 对 NTP 质量无显著影响。\n      叙事定位：Llama-3 结果不是 \"完美复现\" 而是 \"consistent trend\"——\n      gap 存在、gate 无增量、方向一致，但效应量级受架构调节。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B Three-Way Eval (held-out)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"GAR-ours (mid)\", \"GAR-Dongre (mid)\", \"PPL\", \"NTP Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.0135, 0.0042, 3.98, 1.3815]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.0195, 0.028, 2.55, 0.948]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.0188, 0.024, 2.52, 0.941]\n        caption: >\n          Llama-3 复现了 gating 无增量贡献的 pattern（TG ≈ LoRA-only on PPL and GAR）。\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Training-Inference Gap Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", 0.48, 0.28]\n          - [\"Inference GAR-Dongre (held-out)\", 0.032, 0.028]\n          - [\"GAR gap ratio\", \"~15x\", \"~10x\"]\n          - [\"TG - LoRA GAR-Dongre\", \"+0.7pp (n.s.)\", \"+0.4pp (n.s.)\"]\n          - [\"Gate wrong-direction frac\", \"96%\", \"78%\"]\n        caption: >\n          两模型方向一致但量级受架构调节。标题级 claim 应为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\" 而非精确倍数。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Side-by-side bar charts，左 Qwen 右 Llama，每组 3 bars (Base/TG/LoRA-only) 的 GAR-Dongre。TG 和 LoRA-only 的 bar 几乎等高，远低于 training GAR 虚线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨模型比较的核心叙事：distribution shift 是 architecture-general 的，\n      但 gap 量级受架构特性（GQA vs MHA、层数、RoPE 实现）调节。\n      这既是 strength（普遍性）也是 limitation（不能 claim 精确的 gap 倍数）。\n      论文中需要一个 paragraph 讨论为什么 Llama-3 的 gap 更小，\n      候选解释：GQA 的 KV sharing 减缓 attention 稀释 +\n      Llama-3 更大的训练数据可能包含更多多轮对话 pattern。\n      但不应过度解读——两个模型、单 seed 不足以做因果推断。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Gradient Conflict Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate checkpoint 上计算 NTP vs GAR 梯度冲突，验证跨模型一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      l3_grad_cos_sim_avg: -0.038\n      l3_grad_cos_sim_std: 0.045\n      l3_grad_cos_sim_negative_layer_frac: 0.63\n      l3_grad_mag_ratio_avg: 4.2\n      l3_grad_mag_ratio_std: 2.0\n      l3_grad_conflict_consistent_with_qwen: \"directionally yes, weaker magnitude\"\n      l3_layers_with_conflict: 20  # out of 32\n      l3_gqa_group_analysis: \"conflict stronger in groups with fewer query heads per KV head\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3 的梯度冲突弱于 Qwen（cos_sim -0.038 vs -0.050），\n      与 training GAR peak 更低一致——GAR loss 的梯度本身更小，\n      所以与 NTP 梯度的冲突在 magnitude 上更温和。\n      63% 层为负（vs Qwen ~68%），落在 median 范围的合理区间。\n      GQA 结构带来一个独特分析视角：不同 group 内的冲突可能不同。\n      具有更少 query heads per KV head 的 group 冲突更强——\n      因为 gate 调整对这些 group 的 attention 影响更集中。\n      这个 GQA-specific 的 finding 增加 mechanistic insight 的深度，\n      但也可能被 reviewer 认为是 over-interpretation（单模型、单 seed）。\n      幅度比 4.2x（vs Qwen 5.8x）再次确认 Llama-3 上效应更弱但同向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Gradient Conflict Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (28L)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B (32L)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cos_sim avg\", -0.050, -0.038]\n          - [\"Negative layer frac\", \"68%\", \"63%\"]\n          - [\"NTP/GAR mag ratio\", \"5.8x\", \"4.2x\"]\n          - [\"Persistently conflicting layers\", \"14/28 (50%)\", \"20/32 (63%)\"]\n        caption: >\n          两模型均展现 NTP-GAR 梯度冲突，Llama-3 效应更弱但层级覆盖更广（因总层数更多）。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 heatmap 并排，左 Qwen 28 层 x 1 checkpoint，右 Llama 32 层 x 1 checkpoint。颜色编码 cos_sim。两者中间层都是最深蓝但 Llama 整体颜色更浅。\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突跨模型一致性在 median 档下是 \"方向一致但量级不同\"。\n      这对论文是 net positive：证明冲突不是 Qwen 的 artifact，\n      但也表明冲突强度是 architecture-dependent 的。\n      GQA group 分析如果做得好可以是一个 interesting sub-finding，\n      但考虑到只有单 seed、单 checkpoint，建议放 appendix。\n      P1 优先级意味着时间紧张时可以省略此实验——\n      plan_012 的 eval 结果已经足够支持跨模型验证，\n      梯度分析是 mechanistic bonus 而非 must-have。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Sanity Check (Instruction Retention)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      设计简单的 instruction retention test：在 system prompt 中给出格式约束（如 \"回答必须以'[ANS]'开头\"），\n      测量不同 turn 数下各模型的 compliance rate，将 GAR 与下游行为关联。\n    expected_results:\n      # Compliance rate by turn (averaged across 50 instructions)\n      base_compliance_turn1: 0.82\n      base_compliance_turn5: 0.68\n      base_compliance_turn10: 0.52\n      base_compliance_turn15: 0.41\n      base_compliance_turn20: 0.33\n      tg_compliance_turn1: 0.83\n      tg_compliance_turn5: 0.70\n      tg_compliance_turn10: 0.54\n      tg_compliance_turn15: 0.42\n      tg_compliance_turn20: 0.34\n      lora_compliance_turn1: 0.83\n      lora_compliance_turn5: 0.69\n      lora_compliance_turn10: 0.53\n      lora_compliance_turn15: 0.42\n      lora_compliance_turn20: 0.34\n      gar_compliance_correlation: 0.72\n      tg_vs_base_compliance_improvement_avg_pp: 1.5\n      tg_vs_lora_compliance_improvement_avg_pp: 0.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 GAR 与 compliance rate 有中等正相关（r=0.72）——\n      attention to goal tokens 的衰减确实对应 instruction following 的退化，\n      但关系不是 1:1（GAR 是必要非充分条件：\n      模型可能通过 residual stream 中未被 attention 访问的信息仍保持部分 compliance）。\n      Compliance 的衰减曲线比 GAR 更 gentle（从 82% 到 33% vs GAR 从 0.04 到 0.006），\n      因为简单格式指令可以被 model 通过 shortcut 记住（如 learned positional bias）\n      而不完全依赖 attention to goal tokens。\n      关键：TG 对 compliance 几乎无改善（vs base +1.5pp，vs LoRA-only +0.3pp），\n      与 GAR eval 结果一致——推理时 gate 无实际干预能力。\n      这个实验的主要价值不是展示 gating 失败（已有大量证据），\n      而是 validate GAR 作为代理指标的合理性：\n      GAR 衰减确实 track 真实的下游退化，而不只是一个与行为无关的数字。\n      但相关系数 0.72（非 0.95+）也表明 GAR 不是完美代理——\n      需要在论文中承认这个局限性。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction Compliance Rate (%) by Model and Turn\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Turn 15\", \"Turn 20\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 82, 68, 52, 41, 33]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 83, 70, 54, 42, 34]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 83, 69, 53, 42, 34]\n        caption: >\n          所有模型 compliance rate 随 turn 单调下降。\n          TG 对 compliance 的改善 ≤1.5pp，与 GAR eval 一致。\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-Compliance Correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Metric Pair\", \"Pearson r\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"GAR-Dongre vs Compliance (pooled)\", 0.72, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [\"GAR-ours vs Compliance (pooled)\", 0.68, \"<0.001\"]\n        caption: >\n          GAR 与 compliance 中等正相关，支持 GAR 作为代理指标但非完美代理。\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 Y 轴图，左轴 compliance rate (%)，右轴 GAR-Dongre。X 轴 turn index。两条曲线同步下降但斜率不同。标注 r=0.72。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream sanity check 的定位是 address W3（GAR 作为唯一代理指标的质疑）。\n      r=0.72 足以 justify GAR 的 relevance 但不能声称 GAR 是完美代理。\n      论文中可以写 \"GAR decline tracks measurable degradation in instruction following\n      (r=0.72, p<0.001), though the relationship is imperfect,\n      suggesting compensatory mechanisms beyond the attention channel.\"\n      这个实验是 P2 优先级——如果时间充裕则做，如果紧张则在 limitation 中承认\n      \"GAR-to-task correlation was not empirically measured\" 并引用 Dongre 的类似分析。\n      注意 compliance rate 的绝对值（82% at turn 1）可能因指令设计而异——\n      需要选择足够简单的格式约束确保 turn 1 baseline 高，否则 ceiling 太低看不到衰减。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a9b9732d-b919-4101-9fbd-61b486595261","total_cost_usd":0.478998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17266,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":14113,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17266,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14113,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17266,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17266},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":12230,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.012329999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14113,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":17266,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.46666799999999997,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fe21a3ac-cf01-44d4-adca-b01ac21b60df"}
